listing:   overlap_streams.cc
toolchain: Cuda compilation tools, release 12.0, V12.0.140; mpirun (Open MPI) 4.1.6
command:   nvcc -x cu -std=c++17 -O2 -lineinfo -Werror all-warnings -DOMPI_SKIP_MPICXX $(mpicxx --showme:compile) overlap_streams.cc -o overlap_streams -L/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/openmpi/lib -lmpi; mpirun --allow-run-as-root --oversubscribe -np 2 ./overlap_streams
date:      2026-10-10T00:28:12Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container, 4 logical CPUs shared with other jobs; all MPI processes on this one machine, no GPU, no RDMA device)
hardware:  untested on hardware: the build container has no NVIDIA GPU (AH-26); the build is real, the run shows the runtime's own error
exit code: 1
